## Demo Data & Attribution

The demo data included in this application is derived from open data published by the Ministry of the Environment, Government of Japan.

* **Source:** Ministry of the Environment, Government of Japan — *[Chemicals in the Environment (2025)](https://www.env.go.jp/chemi/kurohon/index.html)*
* **Appendix:** Appendix 5: Report Data from High-Frequency Monitoring and Analysis Institutions on POPs Residual Status (`添付資料5 POPs残留状況の高頻度監視分析機関報告データ`)
* **URL:** https://www.env.go.jp/chemi/kurohon/2025/shosai/5_5.pdf
* **License / Terms of Use:** Used in accordance with the [Ministry of the Environment Website Terms of Use](https://www.env.go.jp/other/kiyaku.html) (Public Data License 1.0).

*Note: The dataset has been partially extracted and reformatted for demonstration purposes.*